}],"gloss":"to the lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உரிமை","parts":[{"text":"உரிமை","lemma":"உரிமை","gloss":"marriage right"}],"gloss":"marriage right"},{"surface":"செப்பினர்","parts":[{"text":"செப்பு","lemma":"செப்பு","gloss":"say"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they"}],"gloss":"they agreed"},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"நமர்","gloss":"our people"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"our people indeed"},{"surface":"விரி","parts":[{"text":"விரி","lemma":"விரி","gloss":"bloom"}],"gloss":"blooming"},{"surface":"அலர்","parts":[{"text":"அலர்","lemma":"அலர்","gloss":"blossom"}],"gloss":"blossoms"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்னை","parts":[{"text":"புன்னை","lemma":"புன்னை","gloss":"Punnai tree"}],"gloss":"Punnai tree"},{"surface":"ஓங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கு","lemma":"ஓங்கு","gloss":"rise high"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle"}],"gloss":"lofty"},{"surface":"புலால்","parts":[{"text":"புலால்","lemma":"புலால்","gloss":"fishy smell"}],"gloss":"fishy-smelling"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"euphonic increment"}],"gloss":"euphonic increment"},{"surface":"சேரி","parts":[{"text":"சேரி","lemma":"சேரி","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"hamlet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet"},{"surface":"நகை","parts":[{"text":"நகை","lemma":"நகை","gloss":"smile"}],"gloss":"smiling"},{"surface":"ஆயத்து","parts":[{"text":"ஆயத்து","lemma":"ஆயத்து","gloss":"of the group of playmates"}],"gloss":"of the group of playmates","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆரோடு","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"garland"},{"text":"ஓடு","lemma":"ஓடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the garland"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னும்","lemma":"இன்னும்","gloss":"still"}],"gloss":"still"},{"surface":"அற்றோ","parts":[{"text":"அற்று","lemma":"அற்று","gloss":"like that"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is it like that?"},{"surface":"இவ்","parts":[{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"euphonic glide"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"அழுங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"அழுங்கல்","lemma":"அழுங்கல்","gloss":"noisy"}],"gloss":"noisy"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"village"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"village indeed"}]}],"literal":"O bangled one! Rejoice, speedy curved-legged / burrow-dwelling crab's sharp claws scratched / wet sand's abundant path to be ruined, with a rushing sound / thunderous-sounding wave breaking, to the lord of the shore / marriage right agreed our people indeed. Blooming blossoms / Punnai tree lofty fishy-smelling hamlet / sweet smiling playmates' garland with / still is it like that, this noisy village?","translation":"O bangled one, rejoice! Our relatives have agreed to give you in marriage to the lord of the shore, where waves break with a thunderous sound, washing away the tracks made on the wet sand by the sharp claws of the swift, curved-legged crabs that live in burrows. Is this noisy, fishy-smelling hamlet, where lofty Punnai trees bloom, still busy gossiping about us, even as you stand with your sweet-smiling playmates wearing garlands?","modern":"வளையல்களை அணிந்தவளே! மகிழ்ச்சி அடைவாயாக. வளைகளில் வாழ்கின்ற, விரைந்து செல்லும் வளைந்த கால்களையும் கூர்மையான நகங்களையும் உடைய நண்டுகள் கீறிய ஈரமான மணல் பாதையை அழிக்கும்படி, பெரிய ஒலியோடு அலைகள் வந்து கரையும் துறைவனுக்கு உன்னைத் திருமணம் செய்து கொடுக்க நம் உறவினர்கள் சம்மதித்துவிட்டார்கள். மலர்கள் விரிந்த புன்னை மரங்கள் உயர்ந்த, மீன் நாற்றமுடைய இந்தச் சேரியில், இனிய புன்னகையுடைய தோழியர் கூட்டத்தோடு இருக்கும் உன்னைப் பற்றி இந்த ஆரவாரமுடைய ஊர் இன்னும் அலர் தூற்றிக் கொண்டிருக்கிறதா?","explanation":"This poem is set in the Neytal (coastal) landscape and is spoken by the heroine's friend to the heroine. The friend joyfully informs the heroine that her family has finally accepted the marriage proposal from the hero, the lord of the maritime shore. She tells her to rejoice and cast away her worries. The friend mockingly asks if the noisy, gossiping village is still busy spreading rumors about their secret love, unaware that the formal marriage alliance has already been agreed upon. The image of the thunderous waves washing away the crab's tracks on the wet sand serves as an ullurai (implied metaphor): just as the powerful waves effortlessly erase the marks left by the crabs, the formal marriage alliance will completely sweep away all the petty gossip and obstacles created by the villagers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.05],[2.05,2.1],[2.1,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,5.9],[5.9,6.0],[6.0,7.6],[7.6,7.7],[7.78,7.9],[7.9,8.8],[8.8,9.9],[9.9,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,11.3],[11.3,12.1],[12.1,12.1],[12.1,13.05],[13.05,13.3],[13.3,14.3],[14.3,14.5],[14.5,15.0],[15.0,15.9],[15.97,16.4],[16.42,16.55],[16.55,16.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.76,1.3],[1.3,1.55],[1.7,2.15],[2.15,2.2],[2.2,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.3],[6.3,6.4],[6.4,7.8],[7.8,8.3],[8.34,8.4],[8.4,9.3],[9.3,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,11.9],[11.9,12.9],[12.9,13.0],[13.0,14.11],[14.11,14.4],[14.4,14.9],[14.9,15.4],[15.4,16.4],[16.4,17.3],[17.34,17.4],[17.4,17.46],[17.46,17.76]]},"sync":[[["வளையோய்","O bangled one"]],[["உவந்திசின்","may you rejoice"]],[["விரைவுறு","speedy"]],[["கொடுந்தாள்","curved legs"]],[["அளைவாழ்","burrow-dwelling"]],[["அலவன்","crab"]],[["கூருகிர்","sharp claws"]],[["வரித்த","scratched"]],[["ஈர்மணல்","wet sand"]],[["மலிர்நெறி","abundant path"]],[["சிதைய","to be ruined"]],[["இழுமென","with a rushing sound"]],[["உருமிசைப்","thunderous sound"]],[["புணரி","wave"]],[["உடைதரும்","breaking"]],[["துறைவர்க்கு","to the lord of the shore"]],[["உரிமை","marriage right"]],[["செப்பினர்","they agreed"]],[["நமரே",